WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:01.536
Oh no!

2
00:00:02.063 --> 00:00:07.252
One heart card, somewhere in a thousand cards, and Maya is flipping one by one!

3
00:00:07.779 --> 00:00:11.045
Welcome back to Cloud Town, high up in the sky!

4
00:00:11.572 --> 00:00:13.919
This is Episode 83.

5
00:00:14.446 --> 00:00:16.344
Meet the pointer bird.

6
00:00:16.871 --> 00:00:18.770
Show it what you want.

7
00:00:19.297 --> 00:00:20.547
Zip!

8
00:00:21.074 --> 00:00:24.340
It darts into the pile and pulls out the one card.

9
00:00:24.867 --> 00:00:26.754
Two things at once?

10
00:00:27.281 --> 00:00:30.548
Zip, zip, zip, three boxes.

11
00:00:31.075 --> 00:00:32.844
A smudged drawing?

12
00:00:33.371 --> 00:00:35.989
It still finds the closest match.

13
00:00:36.516 --> 00:00:38.839
It does not read the whole pile.

14
00:00:39.366 --> 00:00:42.043
It already knows where everything is.

15
00:00:42.570 --> 00:00:44.963
That is Amazon OpenSearch.

16
00:00:45.490 --> 00:00:50.938
It finds the right thing in a huge pile, fast, even when you are not sure of the exact word.

17
00:00:51.465 --> 00:00:53.588
Now you know the pointer bird!

18
00:00:54.115 --> 00:00:57.700
See you next time in Cloud Town, high up in the sky!

